arkdown-editor keys through nviminput, owns text, mode, cursor,…","Neovim external UI — RPC-mode errors, warnings, notifications, echoes, Lua prints, and shell output appear as severity-styled, duplicate-limited Obsidian Notices; routine undo and search messages remain silent. A…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/saberzero1/motions/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"ba29b828918a952fd8cc6441af0c39af83842320c352b44a5f5e77fa396e9bc9","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:03.535Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:03.535Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A polished, Neovim-native experience inside Obsidian. Vim Motions adds what's missing from Obsidian's built-in Vim mode: Markdown-aware text objects, structural navigation, hard-wrap formatting, workspace keyboard control, EasyMotion, Lua configuration with vim.keymap.set / vim.opt / vim.fn / vim.api / vim.tbl / autocommands / timers / highlight groups, and a built-in .obsidian.vimrc loader.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/saberzero1/motions/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ba29b828918a952fd8cc6441af0c39af83842320c352b44a5f5e77fa396e9bc9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/saberzero1/motions/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:03.536Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T12:09:17Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/saberzero1/motions/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:03.538Z","hash":"ba29b828918a952fd8cc6441af0c39af83842320c352b44a5f5e77fa396e9bc9","originalBytes":21812,"storedBytes":21812,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["neovim","vim","fold","obsidian","text","mode","lua","cursor","native","navigation","built-in","commands","files","full","line","motions","plugin","bundled","configuration","set","support","across","input","settings","via","buffer","configurable","editor","markdown","npm","objects","oil","picker","api","cm6","external","extmarks","file","fork","gutter","including","